SUMMARY:The Power of Imagination
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nThe P
 ower of Imagination with Modern Buddhism Teacher Jill Cagney\n\nThe mind i
 s rich with creative power. Every day\, it conceives a multitude of realit
 ies. While these experiences may bring us a sense of joy and freedom\, the
 y can also be limiting\, disruptive and even painful. Buddha taught us how
  to use our imagination to see behind our ordinary thinking\, moving us in
 to extraordinary realms of possibility. In truth\, our mind is the creator
  of all we perceive\, even ourselves. Includes guided meditation a talk an
 d time for Q&A. Refreshments served during the break. Everybody Welcome.\n
 Cost: $30 (discounts and online options for members)\n[Read More and Regis
 ter](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/the-power-of-imagination-half-d
 ay-course/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/becom
 e-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31726258
 7/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261102T230759Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102T230759Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
