SUMMARY:Holiday Vegetarian Potluck and Raffle
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nHolid
 ay Vegetarian Potluck and Raffle\n\nCelebrate the Holiday Season with the 
 Je Tsongkhapa Kadampa Meditation Center Community and enjoy our annual Hol
 iday Vegetarian Potluck and Raffle. Bring a vegetarian dish to share. Brin
 g friends and make new ones.\nAnd if you would like to donate a gift certi
 ficate or an item for our raffle please email Jill Cagney at [epc@meditati
 oninasheville.org](mailto:epc@meditationinasheville.org)
